window.products.push({"id":88099,"name":"338906 Flame Sensor & 279834 Gas Valve Solenoid & 3392519 Thermal Fuse Dryer Replacement Part Compatible with Whirlpool Kenmore May.tag Dryers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cve1Lda2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💯【PACKAGE INCLUDES】: 1 x WP338906 gas dryer flame sensor (Senses heat from the igniter allowing gas valve to open), 1 x WP3392519 thermal fuse (Two 3/16\" wire terminals. This fuse is located on the blower housing next to the blower fan. If the dryer overheats, the thermal fuse blows to cut off power to the dryer and/or stop the dryer from running), 1 x 279834 gas valve coil set (One coil is the primary and one is the safety. If one stops working they should be replaced as a pair) 💯【PERFECT REPLACEMENT】: ❶ WP338906 Gas dryer flame sensor replaces 3-3377, 56231, 303377, 338906, 14205529, 14210083, 14218928, 35001096, 63-5013, DC32-00008A, DE353, R0611503, WP338906VP, Y303377, Y56231, 2681, AP6008294, PS11741429, EAP11741429. ❷ WP3392519 Thermal Fuse replaces 80005, 694511, 3388651, 3392519, ET401, G4AP0500, WP3392519VP, PS11741460, AP6008325, 2986, EAP11741460 💯【PERFECT REPLACEMENT】: ❸ 279834 Gas Valve Coil Set replaces 279834BULK, 279834VP, 306105, 306106, 14202750, 14205025, 14210032, 58804B, 63-6615, 694539, 12001349, 14201336, 14201452, 14210725, 14210908, 58804A, 63-6614, 694540, R0610003, R0610050, SCA700, 3479, AP3094251, EAP334310, PS334310. Compatible with Whirlpool, Ken-more, Ad-miral, Amana, Calo-ric, Cro-sley, Es-tate, Ing-lis, Jenn-Air, Kitchen-Aid, Magic-Chef, May-tag, Nor-ge, Ro-per, Speed-Queen dryers 💯【PREMIUM QUALITY & EASY TO INSTALLATION】: Our 338906 dryer flame sensor, 279834 gas dryer coil kit and 3392519 thermal fuse kit is made of high-quality material well-tested by the manufacturer and meets even exceeds OEM standards. Installation can be completed in just a few steps, and you can save space more effectively. Please cut off the power supply before installation 💯【SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE】: Funmit adhere to provide all customers with a simple, streamlined shopping experience of large appliance replacement parts, and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there. We stand by our products, and our customers are our focus as a business. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact Funmit customer service team in time, and we will try our best to solve your problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cve1Lda2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B08C9GKSMW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9GKSMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9GKSMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":88100,"name":"33Lbs Ice Maker Countertop, 10 Ice Cube Ready in 8-9 Mins, Crystal Clear Ice, 33Lbs/24H, Self-Cleaning Clear Ice Maker Machine, 2 Sizes Ice Cube Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u8NMKfT0L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥑Crystal Clear Ice Cubes, Tastes Greater🥑: With our crystal clear ice maker, we can make clear Ice cubes, which taste better than the cloudy ice cubes in the market. 2 sizes of ice cubes can be selected as you want. Clear ice cubes allow you to enjoy a cold drink for longer, without losing the real flavor! 🍓Plenty Amount of Ice Cube Made🍓: With 2.5L water storage, 33 lbs of crystal clear ice can be made within 24h. It's more efficient than the traditional ice maker which only has 26lbs. Don’t worry about that last-minute trip to the store—it makes nearly the same amount as five, 10lb. bags of store-bought ice, which is enough for host gatherings and parties. Ice never runs out. 🥑Fast Freezing Means More Ice🥑: Need ice quick? This crystal Ice maker makes a new batch of ice every few minutes. Make ice fast but still retain perfect clarity. It only takes 8 mins to make 10 small ice, and 9 mins for large per circle. Use the included scoop and removable ice tray to empty it regularly, and you'll have enough ice for any occasion. (Attention: Please put the ice into the freezer ASAP in case it melts.) 🍓Compact Design & Portable🍓: This countertop columnar clear Ice maker measured size 14.9(H)*10(D)''. Its compact design makes it ideal for any countertop for everyday use as well as for camping and boating. 🥑User-Friendly Operation for Ultimate Simplicity🥑: This crystal clear ice maker is designed for the ultimate ease of use—add water, select the ice size, the default mode is large ice, and wait for the ice cubes made. No need to check the machine and indicator lights will let you know when ice is ready, or when water needs to be added to the tank. It is user-friendly for children and elders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u8NMKfT0L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LyriFine","source_asin":"B0B4JFQNJ4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JFQNJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JFQNJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
