window.products.push({"id":88237,"name":"Homtone Built-in Gas Cooktop 34 inch, Gas Stove Glass Top With 5 Sealed Burners 36004 BTU Total, Black Tempered Glass Gas Cooktop Gas Hob, NG/LPG Conv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iiglgoulL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 Cooking Burners】The recessed gas cooktop features five sealed gas burners (3413BTU*1, 5972BTU*2, 9385BTU*1, 11262BTU*1), can satisfy different cooking flame need. Making sauces, warming milk, melting chocolate or boiling water can all be done on the countertop stove with power-adjustable burners. This built-in gas stove is a great addition to any kitchen. 【Durable Tempered Glass Surface】The gas stoves hob has 8mm tempered glass cooktop surface, looks modern and provides stain resistance and heat discoloration, avoiding cleaning bothering, the sealed burners prevent food from dropping into the gas stove. The glass panel can keep new after long-time use. 【Thermocouples Protection】Built-in FFD (Flame Failure Device), each burner ensures the gas will shutoff automatically if the flame goes out accidentally, avoiding the gas leakage and providing cooking safety. Suitable for multi-purpose such as family cooking, mobile home, RVs, small kitchen, even outdoor use. 【LPG/NG Convertible】The gas conversion kit is included in the package, with which the preset natural gas can be switched to liquefied gas as needed. 2 gas supply option makes cooking convenient and can work manually w/o electricity. Compatible to install the gas stove above a built-in oven. 【Drop-in Installation】The built-in stove, space-saving and easy to clean, brings out a more harmonious kitchen arrangement, and convenient for matching design with other kitchen utensils to create a comfortable cooking environment. The product size is L/W/H: 874x510x100mm /34x20x3.95\" and the built-in size is L/W: 840x480mm/33x18.9\". 【Quality Warranty】Homtone gas stove is certified by CSA & ETL and we provide a 12-month warranty for the gas cooktop, replace a new set directly once it has any quality problems. If you encounter any product after-sales problems, you can contact the our support team at any time, professional team is always online.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iiglgoulL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homtone","source_asin":"B0B461HJKR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B461HJKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B461HJKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
