window.products.push({"id":88374,"name":"Range Hood Insert 36 Inch 600CFM Stainless Steel, Built-in Vent Hood Ducted/Ductless Convertible, 3-Speed Exhaust Fan, Dual LED lights, Split Type Per","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A-h8vLaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Split Deep-Groove Stainless Steel Baffle Filter】The insert range hood comes with 3 split, durable and easy cleaning stainless steel permanent grease filter, which is designs with deep grooves to catch grease before they drip down on your cabinets, countertops, walls, and floors. Split filters with smaller size for each one, which is easier to put it into your dishwasher for cleaning. 【Competent for Heavy-Duty Cooking】Built in range hood 36 inch comes with wider range and a powerful and ultra-quiet blower system, which can make your kitchen hood reach 600 Cubic Feet Per Minute large capacity and control noise level does not exceed 60db even at the highest speed. Remove harmful grease, fume and odor, make you enjoy your cooking anytime. 【Matching Size for Most Kitchens】JOEAONZ 36 inch insert range hood has an ideal size for most standard 36\" cabinet, you don't need to worry about install problem of size. Premium brushed stainless steel front board can avoid damage from high heat, grease, oil and steam, it can bright as ever after simlpe cleaning. 【Dual Bright LED Lights】JOEAONZ 36 inch insert vent hood come with two bright and energy saving LED lights, both sides of your stove can be lighted up. Customize the 36 inch kitchen hood with the 3-speed setting to meet cooking needs such as boiling, steaming, poaching, braising, frying, searing, and sauteing. 【Convertible Ducted/Ductless Installation】For families without reserved air outlet in the kitchen, JOEAONZ 36\" built-in range hood provides a convertible installation method. You may easily convert this range hood for your kitchen with a pair of highly concentrated charcoal filters [YYCF02] (sold separately). We provide 3 year manufacturer warranty for this 36’’ range hood , If you need any assistance, please feel free to email us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A-h8vLaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOEAONZ","source_asin":"B0BZ7BXC2N","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ7BXC2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ7BXC2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
