window.products.push({"id":88625,"name":"ARLIME 2 in 1 Compact Mini Laundry Machine Full-Automatic Washing Machine 1.5 Cu.Ft Capacity Portable Laundry Washer & Spin Dryer W/ Long Inlet & Outl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oqF52fA8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👗Intelligent Full-Automatic Technology - ARLIME mini laundry machine equipped with Fuzzy, Heavy, Gentle, Speedy, Soak & Wash, Single Wash, Single Spin, and Air Dry 8 programs and 10 water level selection. At normal mode, it can adjust the water level based on load size automatically, you are allowed to quickly start the machine and leave it alone to do your own things. You are also welcomed to customize your washing program and water levels by adding wash time, rinse time, and spin time. 👖Powerful Performance - The full-automatic washer machine features a 720 RPM powerful motor with a max frequency of 60Hz.Ultrasonic turbine adopts to advanced high-frequency vibration, 360 degrees forward reverse cleaning, deep clean. A 300 W washing power, a spinner power of 250 W, and 1.5 Cu. Ft 11lbs large capacity for washing more clothes at once. This mini washer manages to remove even the toughest stains, and although it’s small, it is remarkably powerful and works quietly. 👗Compact Washer - Made from stainless steel, this portable clothes washing machine has a size of 19*19*33 inches, and it weighs only 57.5 lbs. In addition, this mini washer has a DOE certificate that can save as much as 87.5% energy consumption comparing to similar models. It's a space-saving and energy-saving washer and would be the perfect laundering option for condos, dorms, guest houses, RV, and apartment dwellers. 👖Easy Of Use - This compact washing machine is designed with side handles for you to move conveniently. Automatic imbalance correction and the adjustable feet enable it to keep the balance even in vibration. Besides, the clear folding lid makes it easier to check the washing process. What's important, if laundry is finished or you do not press START/PAUSE in 10 minutes after pressing power, the power supply will be cut off automatically. 👗User-Friendly Design - ARLIME compact laundry washer equipped with an inlet hose of 50.5'' as well as a long outlet pump of 71'' with a drainage pump so that you can easily drain the water. What's more, It built-in a lint filter - just clean it about twice a month and remove any accumulated lint, hairs, and other debris which attach to the clothes. At last, the spin cycle pretty much removed all the water, after this, you can also try using the air dry program to dry your cloth quickly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oqF52fA8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARLIME","source_asin":"B09BF2R2ZJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BF2R2ZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BF2R2ZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
