window.products.push({"id":88693,"name":"30\" Electric Cooktop Ceramic Stove Built-in 4 Burners IsEasy Countertop Burners Cooker Satin Glass in Black Touch Sensor Control,Child Safety Lock,Tim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lNtaUPjML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 30\" Electric Cooktop Ceramic Stove 4 Burners which are 1200W+2000W+2400W+1600W elements that feature 9 heating level settings and touch sensor controls for precise, easy temperature change at the touch of a button. Heating levels range from a light simmer to a rapid boil. This 30\" electric cooktop ceramic stove also has a Smooth vitro ceramic glass surface for durable use and quick, easy cleaning.Applied with multiple safety devices, such as Over-heating Protection, Hot Surface Indicator, Child Lock and Auto-Shutoff. 🎉Make cooking easier and enjoy leisure cooking time with family or friends.👨‍👩‍👦 Feature: 🍷Cooking Zones: Top Left: 1200W Top Right: 2000W(1100W+900W) Down Left: 2400W(800W+800W+800W) Down Right: 1600W 🍷Technical Specification: Colour: Black Finish: Satin Glass Width: 30.3inch Number of Zones: 4  Type: Ceramic Heat Indicator Light: Yes Control Location: Front Control Type: Touch Control Electrical Fuse Rating:36 amp Maximum Power Rating: 7200 Watts Cut Out Size: WxD:29.1*19.3inch Product Dimensions W x D x H: 30.3x20.4x2inch Product Weight: Gross Weight:31.4lb;Net Weight:28.66lb Installation Guidelines: The 30\" electric cooktop ceramic stove 4 burners should be installed by suitably qualified persons.Due to high voltage the electric,plug is not included,we suggest to be hardwired directly onto 240V outlet. ❤️IMPORTANT: Before cleaning the 30\" electric cooktop ceramic stove 4 burners, make sure the cooking zones are switched off and that the residual heat indicator (“H”) is not displayed. Do not use abrasive sponges or scouring pads. Their use could eventually ruin the glass.Use a soft cloth, absorbent kitchen paper or a specific hob cleaner (follow the Manufacturer’s instructions). ❤️Package includes: 1*30\" electric cooktop ceramic stove 1*Power cord 1*Install instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lNtaUPjML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IsEasy","source_asin":"B08W58ZMR7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W58ZMR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W58ZMR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":88694,"name":"Kwasyo Portable Countertop Dishwasher with Fully Automatic Pumping Water,Rotating Powerful Spray Arms & Air-Drying Function,158℉ High-Temperature Clea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pKpS2ZgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LED Touch Screen】: one-key operation. After selecting the washing program, ①Water intake②Drainage③Air drying all automatic. Even the elderly can use it easily. In addition, it has a black premium appearance. It is not only a dishwashing tool but also a wonderful decoration for the kitchen. Suitable for small apartments, dormitories, boats, and RVs. 【Small Size, Large Capacity】: It is both a dishwasher and a storage cabinet, which can hold a 22cm max diameter disc, a 32cm long plate, a 16cm high soup bowl, and a 12cm high rice bowl. 2-4 sets of tableware can be stored at the same time to meet the capacity of a small family. In addition, there is a 30-minute fresh air circulation every two hours, and the tableware can be stored for a long time without a peculiar smell. 【4 Washing Programs】: powerful washing, standard washing, quick washing, and rinsing, which can be completed in 10 minutes at the fastest. 360° rotating spray arm up and down, clean without dead corners.158℉ high-temperature hot water is good for faster dissolution of oil stains, enhances the cleaning effect of detergents. 【Two Ways To Use, Small Kitchen Essentials】: Connecting the faucet, The principle of water intake and drainage is the same as that of the washing machine. If you don't want to fix it in one place, you can also fill a bucket with water and put our suction pipe into the bucket, the machine will automatically absorb water, and will automatically drain after washing. Water separator Included = faucet adapter & multi-purpose 【Save Water/Electricity/Time】: It consumes about 0.01Kwh of electricity in ten minutes. The single water consumption is between 5.8L-10.7L, depending on the washing program. The wash countdown display on the control panel allows you to know the washing progress in real-time. Dishwashers are much more time-saving and worry-free than hand-washing tableware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pKpS2ZgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kwasyo","source_asin":"B092HXB8SK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092HXB8SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092HXB8SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
