window.products.push({"id":88828,"name":"Broan F404202 Two-Speed Four-Way Convertible Range Hood, 42-Inch, Bisque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21loUaYn2AL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The simple style of the Broan 42-Inch Convertible Four Way Under Cabinet Range Hood may fool you. But, this ADA compliant unit is efficient and easy-to-use. Its four-way convertibility offers multiple installation options, including 3.25 x 10-Inch with vertical or horizontal discharge, 7-Inch round with vertical discharge, and a non-ducted alternative. Regardless of how it's installed, this hood's durable fan will knock out any unwanted cooking smoke and order. Operating the fan is easy with a conveniently located switch. A similar switch activates a protective lamp lens that provides extra cook-top illumination when you need it. To keep it performing at its best and keep your kitchen smelling fresh, you just toss its aluminum grease filter in the dishwasher. HVI Certified and UL Listed, there's no doubt this unit can perform. From the Manufacturer The Broan F40000 Series convertible Range Hoods adapt to any installation. These 4-way convertible range hoods will fit into most all applications. Enclosed light and fan/filter assemblies make for easy cleaning. Since 1932, Broan-NuTone LLC has led the industry with forward-thinking residential ventilation products, unsurpassed built-in convenience products and superior customer service. While global expertise plays a critical role in Broan-NuTone's ability to being able to meet and exceed the needs and desires of homeowners and designers alike, Broan-NuTone is very proud of the fact that over 80-percent of their products sold in the United States are designed, engineered and manufactured in the United States with U.S. and imported parts. Broan-NuTone is committed to developing revolutionary products that improve the indoor environment as well as implementing procedures to preserve the outdoor environment. Broan-NuTone offers a wide selection of products that help meet the requirements of all three major green building programs: ENERGY STAR, U.S. Green Building Council's (USGBC) Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED) for Homes, and the National Association of Home Builder's (NAHB) Model Green Home Building Guidelines. Broan-NuTone's inspiring heritage provides the foundation for its three award-winning, global brands-Broan, NuTone and BEST. BEST range hoods are the \"Ultimate in Kitchen Ventilation\" featuring state-of-the-art performance and Italian design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21loUaYn2AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan","source_asin":"B001E6DLZK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001E6DLZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001E6DLZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
