window.products.push({"id":88845,"name":"Freezimer Ice Maker Machine for Countertop, 33 lbs/24Hrs, 9 Cubes Ready in 6 Mins Self-Cleaning Electric Ice Machine with Basket and Ice Scoop,Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":118.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h07Q4nAvL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"6 Mins Fast and Quiet Ice Making: The ice maker only takes only 6 minutes for the ice maker to produce 9 freezing ice cubes and it could produce 33 pounds of ice per day. When making ice cubes, the noise is very lower that not disturb your daily life. Easy to Use: Our compact ice maker control panel is very easy to use. Fill the ice maker with water, press the ON button, and select the size of the ice cubes ( you can choose different sizes of ice cubes LARGE or SMALL according to your needs). Besides, this compact ice maker has advanced infrared sensor technology. The \"ADD WATER\" indicator turns on when the ice maker is lack water and the \"ICE FULL\" indicator turns on when the ice basket is full. Self-Cleaning Function: The electric ice maker is equipped with a self-cleaning system, you only need to add water to the sink and long-press the ON/OFF button for 5 seconds, then the machine starts to auto-clean, when the cleaning is done, open the small rubber stopper at the bottom to empty the dirty water from the ice maker. This feature makes you have fresh and clean ice every day. Stylish design &Wide Applications： The portable ice maker is portable and compact ( 11(D)*9.4(W)*13.9(H) inches. ) and designed in premium brushed stainless steel. You can place it anywhere, like Home/Kitchen/Office/RV/Party/Bar/Swimming pool. Besides, we also offer an ice basket and ice scoop, so you can move the ice very easily. The top is covered with a transparent window, and you can see the ice-making process. WARRANTY & SUPPORT: Freezimer self-cleaning ice maker offers a 12-month warranty if you have any problems, please feel free to contact us. Note: You'd better put the ice maker upright for at least 24 hours before using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h07Q4nAvL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freezimer","source_asin":"B0C659L2L6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C659L2L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C659L2L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
