window.products.push({"id":88853,"name":"DC97-16782A Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung Drum Roller DV45K6500EV/A3 DV48J7700EW/A2 DVE50M7450W/A3 DV42H5200EF/A3 DV210AGW/XAA DV218AEB/XAA DV337AEG/XA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C9dU4wJjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dc97-16782a Dryer Drum Roller - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5325135, DC97-16782C, DC97-16782D, 2027851, DC97-07523A, DC97-07523B, PS4221885. Dc97-16782a Dryer Roller is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore appliances. Dryer rollers fit hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. Its diameter is approximately 3-1/4 inches. By replacing this part as needed, you can help to extend the life of your dryer and ensure that it continues to perform at its best. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC97-16782A Drum Rollers will help if your appliance is noisy. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. When replacing the DC97-16782A Drum Roller, it is important to ensure that the new part is installed correctly. This may require the use of specialized tools, such as a socket wrench or pliers. 💡 DC97-16782A Drum Roller is a small wheel that is mounted on the axle. It is typically made of durable rubber or plastic, and its purpose is to support the weight of the dryer drum as it rotates. The drum support roller also helps to reduce friction between the drum and the dryer cabinet, which can help to prolong the life of the dryer. DC97-16782A Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How many rollers are on a dryer drum? The number of rollers on a dryer drum can vary depending on the make and model of the dryer. However, most dryers have two or more rollers that support the drum and allow it to rotate smoothly during operation. Some dryers have two rollers located at the back of the drum, while others may have additional rollers located at the front of the drum or on the sides. It's important to check your dryer's model to determine the number of rollers it has. 💡 Popular Models: dv210aew, dv220aew/xaa, dv22k6800ew/a1, dv231aew/xaa, dv330aeb-xaa, dv361ewbewr/a3, dv400ewhdwr, dv405etpawr-aa, dv40j3000ew/a2, dv40j3000gw/a2, dv410aew/xaa, dv422ewhdwr/aa, dv42h5000ew/a3, dv42h5000gw/a3, dv42h5200ep/a3, dv42h5200ew/a3, dv42h5200gp/a3, dv42h5600ep/a3, dv448agp/xaa, dv456ewhdwr/aa, dv45h6300gg/a3, dv45h7000ep/a3, dv45h7000ew/a2, dv45h7000gw/a2, dv45k6200ew/a3, dv45k6500gv/a3, dv48h7400ew/a2, dv48h7400gw/a2, dv48j7700gw/a2, dv48j7770ew/a2, dv48j7770gp.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C9dU4wJjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B09DQ8KLMN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-88853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DQ8KLMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DQ8KLMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
